Lustre community,

It's my pleasure to announce the availability of an open CVS  
repository for Lustre source code. You can now get the latest sources  
from this anonymous, read-only pserver, which is synchronized against  
the master source tree once every hour.

Details on how to check out Lustre are available on Lustre.org: http://wiki.lustre.org/index.php?title=Open_CVS

Details on how to build Lustre are available in the Operations Manual: http://manual.lustre.org/

Cheers,
Bojanic
